n and optional branches</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch005.xhtml#c4-the-mandatory-chain-and-optional-branches"/></navPoint><navPoint id="navPoint-54" playOrder="54"><navLabel><text>Data received by Bercy from September 2026</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch005.xhtml#c4-data-received-by-bercy-from-september-2026"/></navPoint><navPoint id="navPoint-55" playOrder="55"><navLabel><text>September 2027, invoice lines become data</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch005.xhtml#c4-september-2027-invoice-lines-become-data"/></navPoint><navPoint id="navPoint-56" playOrder="56"><navLabel><text>Safeguards imposed on approved platforms</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch005.xhtml#c4-safeguards-imposed-on-approved-platforms"/></navPoint><navPoint id="navPoint-57" playOrder="57"><navLabel><text>Where does the approved platform end?</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch005.xhtml#c4-where-does-the-approved-platform-end"/></navPoint><navPoint id="navPoint-58" playOrder="58"><navLabel><text>Public policies describe different products</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch005.xhtml#c4-public-policies-describe-different-products"/></navPoint><navPoint id="navPoint-59" playOrder="59"><navLabel><text>The accountant becomes a reader under an engagement</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch005.xhtml#c4-the-accountant-becomes-a-reader-under-an-engagement"/></navPoint><navPoint id="navPoint-60" playOrder="60"><navLabel><text>Banking, payments and credit: document each use</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch005.xhtml#c4-banking-payments-and-credit-document-each-use"/></navPoint><navPoint id="navPoint-61" playOrder="61"><navLabel><text>An external assistant opens a second exit</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch005.xhtml#c4-an-external-assistant-opens-a-second-exit"/></navPoint><navPoint id="navPoint-62" playOrder="62"><navLabel><text>The missing CNIL documents</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch005.xhtml#c4-the-missing-cnil-documents"/></navPoint><navPoint id="navPoint